ody</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Gamst</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Lau</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Dolnak</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Depression, visual acuity, comorbidity and disabilityassociated with comorbid macular degeneration</article-title><source>Ophthalmology</source><year>2001</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>1893</fpage><lpage>900</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11581068</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rovner</surname><given-names>BW</given-names></name><name><surname>Casten</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Tasman</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of depression on visionfunction in age-related macular degeneration</article-title><source>Arch Ophthalmol</source><year>2002</year><volume>120</volume><fpage>1041</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12149057</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rovner</surname><given-names>BW</given-names></name><name><surname>Casten</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hegel</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Tasman</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Minimal depressionand vision function in age-related macular degeneration</article-title><source>Ophthalmology</source><year>2006</year><volume>113</volume><fpage>1743</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16893569</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="re